OL,3,AFive men arrested near RAF Fairford on
OL,4,Asuspicion of terror offences were UK
OL,5,Anationals from London, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,9,FSunday morning are UK nationals in
OL,10,Ftheir 20s who live in London, police
OL,11,Fsay
OL,13,FThey were arrested under the Explosives
OL,14,FAct and on suspicion of preparing a
OL,15,Fterrorist act
OL,17,FCounter Terrorism Policing Senior
OL,18,FNational Coordinator Vicki Evans says
OL,19,Fshe is "very aware of the levels of
OL,20,Fspeculation about the motivation behind
OL,21,Fthis incident, and the geopolitical
OL,22,Fquestions that are being raised"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
